linux-screen-share (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * CLI tool (linuxshare-cli) for X11 and Wayland screen capture into a
    v4l2loopback virtual camera.
  * GTK4 GUI (linuxshare-gui) with monitor/window picker, tray icon and
    settings.

 -- LinuxShare Contributors  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:00:00 +0000
